 name to Netskope, Inc. in November 2012. Netskope, Inc. was incorporated in 2012 and is based in Santa Clara, California.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Sanjay  Beri | Co-Founder, CEO & Chairman | Age 49 | Compensation: $1.1M (FY2026)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 3K people. Revenue per employee of $216K ranks in the bottom quartile among Technology peers. Each employee generates $5K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $157K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 5\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity).","financial_summary":["Netskope, Inc. is a mid-cap technology business with a $8.7B market cap on $709M of annual revenue.","Gross margins of 68% are the starting point for assessing pricing power.","The business throws off $15M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 2 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders.","Accruals are elevated at -40.5% of assets, and Sloan showed firms building earnings through accruals rather than cash systematically underperform.","On the balance sheet, interest coverage of 40\u00d7 is fortress-like.","Shareholder yield is only 0.0%, a thin return of capital, and stock-based comp at 73% of revenue is silent dilution an owner has to account for, and insiders hold 3.6% of the shares, and profit capture is only 0.0\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Price sits 582% above estimated fair value \u2014 no margin of safety left, and the cushion against estimate error has been bid away","sev":"red","cat":"valuation","magnitude":5.822311391890607},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.9) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Operating margins 99% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 8.2% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Technology sector lagging the market significantly, underperforming by 7% over 3 months","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Elevated sector volatility (35% annualized) adds uncertainty","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Above-average market volatility (VIX 26)","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Late-cycle dynamics increase the probability of a slowdown","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Cybersecurity liability and talent cost inflation \u2014 a single breach can erase years of goodwill, and the war for engineering talent compresses margins even at scale.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Valued at a 177% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","Insiders are net buyers (78% buy ratio) \u2014 insiders sell for many reasons but buy for only one","Large open-market insider purchases (net $21.6M) \u2014 management putting its own capital behind the business","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Netskope (NASDAQ:NTSK) Now Covered by Cantor Fitzgerald","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/04/netskope-nasdaqntsk-now-covered-by-cantor-fitzgerald.html","date":"2026-11-04","timestamp":1793801805.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.67,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Netskope (NASDAQ:NTSK) Stock Gets Price Target Increase from BTIG Research","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/02/netskope-nasdaqntsk-stock-gets-price-target-increase-from-btig-research.html","date":"2026-11-02","timestamp":1793625190.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.71,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["analyst_action"]},{"title":"Inspi